hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2777","Narrated to us Abd al-Jabbar ibn al-'Ala and Ahmad ibn Mani' al-Makhzumi, they said: Narrated to us Sufyan, on the authority of 'Amr ibn Dinar, on the authority of 'Ata, on the authority of Ibn 'Abbas (RA), who said:\n\The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) and his Companions performed Sa'i between the Safa and Marwah solely so that the polytheists would see their strength.\""\nAl-Makhzumi added: \""So that Quraysh would see his strength.\""\n\nCHAPTER:"""""
